{"id":"televidenie","lemma":"телевидение","pos":"noun","rank":3072,"glosses":["television (medium)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b5/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"телевидения","plural":"телевидения"},"examples":[{"text":"Вы можете смотреть телевидение.","en":"You can watch television.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to look, to gaze"},null]},{"text":"Это телевидение.","en":"It's a TV.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Тогда не было ни телевидения, ни радио.","en":"There was no TV or radio in those days.","words":[{"g":"then"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"not a"},null,{"g":"not a"},{"g":"radio"}]},{"text":"Вы можете себе представить, какой была бы жизнь без телевидения?","en":"Can you imagine what life would be like without television?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"myself","l":"себя"},{"g":"to present, to offer"},{"g":"what, what one"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Я не думаю, что телевидение заменит книги.","en":"I don't think television will take the place of books.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,{"g":"what / that"},null,{"g":"to replace","l":"заменить"},{"g":"book","l":"книга"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"I don't think so"]]}]}